<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
<template id="report_promotion_letter">
     <t t-call="web.html_container">
            <t t-foreach="docs" t-as="o">
                <t t-call="web.external_layout">
                    <div class="page">
                        <div class="row mt32">
                            <div class="col-8">

                            </div>
                            <div class="col-4" style="float:left;">
                                 <strong>Date.:</strong>
                                <span t-esc="datetime.date.today()"/>
                                <br/>
                                  <strong>Ref. No.</strong>
                                    <span t-field="o.app_reference"/>
                                  <br />
                                <strong>ID.No.:</strong>
                                 <span t-field="o.employee_number"/>
                                <br />
                                  <br/>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                         <div class="row mt32">
                              <div class="col-12">
                                <strong><span t-field="o.partner_name"/></strong>
                                <br/>
                                <strong>Dear <span t-field="o.partner_name"/>,</strong>
                            </div>
                             </div>
                        <h6 class="text-center"><strong><u>Subject: - Promotion</u></strong></h6>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Considering your experience and remarkable contribution to the Bank, I am pleased to inform you that you are promoted to the post of <strong><span t-field="o.job_id"/></strong>  with Job Grade <strong><span t-field="o.job_grade_id"/> </strong> and assigned at <strong>o.assigned_work_unit</strong> effective the date you assume your new position.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Commencing the date, you assume the new position, your monthly gross salary is raised to   <strong>Birr <span t-field="o.job_grade_id.base_salary"/></strong> and entitlement of other benefits attached for the job grade.</p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>Your assignment to this post is indeed a clear indication of the Bank’s confidence in you to carry out your duties and responsibilities to its entire satisfaction with the expected standard of the Bank. </p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>By copy of this letter, <strong><span t-field="o.preferred_location"/></strong> is advised to release <strong><span t-field="o.partner_name"/></strong> and forward Payroll related information, Outstanding loan Account details, Leave status, and any other necessary information to <strong>o.cc_workunits</strong></p>
                        <br/>
                        <p>I hope you will capitalize on your achievement to date and look forward to enhanced performance of the   <strong>-------</strong> in all the responsibility areas bestowed upon you.</p>
                        <br/>
                    </div>
                <div>
                               <div class="row mt32">
                                   <br/>
                             <div class="col-6" >
                                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                                 <br/>
                                 <br/>


                                 <strong>CC:</strong>
								 <t t-foreach="o.cc_workunits" t-as="related_record">
                                    <li><t t-esc="related_record.name"/></li>
                                    <!-- Add more fields as needed -->
                                </t>
								 
                                 <!-- <ul> -->
                                     <!-- <li>Debre Berhan Area Office</li> -->
                                     <!-- <li>IT Security Management Directorate</li> -->
                                     <!-- <li>Mehal Meda Branch</li> -->
                                      <!-- <li>Bunna Bank S.C </li> -->
                                 <!-- </ul> -->

<!--                                <span t-field="o.resignation_type" />-->
                                  <br />
                             </div>

                        </div>

                </div>

                </t>
            </t>
        </t>
</template>
</odoo>
